title: Faust1
---
<<declare $playerName = "Holder">>
<<gathervars>>
<<freezePlayer>>
You enter the gym and head to the wrestling room.

You expected it to be empty, but it's packed.

"Oh, {$playerName}!"

Faust jogs over in full gear, waving.

You wave back.

You: "Sorry...bad time?"

You feel out of place in your normal clothes.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Did you not get the email?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You blink blankly.

You: "Uhh..."

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "We're doing sparring matches today."
Faust: "It's optional, don't worry."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You relax slightly.

Before you speak, he grabs your shoulder.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "I want you to watch my match."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You blink in surprise.

-> Refuse him
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump RefuseHim>>
-> Go along with it
    <<jump GoAlongWith>>
-> Stay for his match
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump Stay4Match>>
===

title: RefuseHim
---
You shrug his hand off.

You: "Sorry, I'm busy."

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "It won't take long."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

Before you reply, he moves you anyway.

<<jump Faust1Next>>
===

title: GoAlongWith
---
You let him guide you.

His grip is firm, controlling.

You hesitate to pull away.

He places you where you can see clearly.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Stay here. It won't take long."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You could leave...but don't.

<<jump Faust1Next>>
===

title: Stay4Match
---
You nod.

You: "Who are you fighting?"

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "One of the strongest here."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He looks completely calm.

You: "You don't know his name?"

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "I don't need to."
Faust: "It'll be over quickly."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He places you to watch.

<<jump Faust1Next>>
===

title: Faust1Next
---
Faust gets into position and winks.

Then his expression shifts—cold, focused.

The whistle blows.

The match begins instantly.

Faust dodges fast, striking back quickly.

Both circle each other carefully.

Then—he sweeps and pins.

The coach slaps the mat.

Match over.

The crowd praises him.

Faust beams at them.

You approach.

He notices you instantly.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Told you it'd be quick."
Faust: "How did I do?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

-> You did well
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump YouDidWell>>
-> You were good
    <<jump YouWereGood>>
-> Why do you need my opinion?
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump WhyDoYouNeed>>
===

title: YouDidWell
---
You: "You did well!"

He lights up even more.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Heh, I knew it."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

<<jump EndF1>>
===

title: YouWereGood
---
You: "You were good."

His smile dips slightly.

Then others praise him again.

He perks right back up.

<<jump EndF1>>
===

title: WhyDoYouNeed
---
You: "Why do you need my opinion?"

He frowns briefly.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Oh...okay."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He turns back to others.

<<jump EndF1>>
===

title: EndF1
---
Matches continue as Faust cleans up.

You wait outside on your phone.

He comes out, hair damp.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Hey...thanks for watching."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You: "No problem."

He rummages in his pocket.

He hands you a note.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Your answer. Figured that's why you came."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You nod, reading quickly.

Satisfied, you smile.

You: "Thank you."

You grab your things.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "No problem."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He waves.

You leave the gym.
<<allowPlayerToMove>>
<<loadScene "CampusGrounds">>
===